" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="ch5c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Base -&amp;gt; Plan_OPT_EU (one row per day, shift and product slot)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Grain: for each day, each of the 5 shift types x 4 product slots that holds a Code, Volume or Temps becomes one row. The macro rule of the PlanOPT sheet is reproduced where it was checked on the files. Target columns and examples follow the EU extract (diagrams/data/eu-extract-profile.json).&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1500" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c3" value="&lt;b&gt;FROM BASE, CHECKED ON THE FILES&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="230" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c4" value="&lt;b&gt;FIXED VALUE OR LOOKUP (CONFIG)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="90" width="230" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c5" value="&lt;b&gt;RULE TO CONFIRM&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="90" width="230" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c6" value="&lt;b&gt;NO SOURCE IN THE CHARTRES FILES&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor